Output output/user_functions.mp4
Set FontSize 40
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 40
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 400ms
Set Shell bash

Hide
Type "./calcx"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2500ms

Type "my_func(x) = x^2+1"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "my_func(4)"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "my_func(var_one, var_two) = var_one*2 + sqrt(var_two)"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "my_func(4, 9)"
Enter
Sleep 2s
